# Accounts (optional). Copy to .env.local for development; on Vercel set them as Environment Variables.
# With either one empty the site is the guest game: no sign-in, no network calls to Supabase.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC and ship in the page: the project URL and the anon / publishable key
# (Supabase dashboard, Project Settings, API). Row Level Security is what protects the data.
# NEVER put the service_role / secret key here or anywhere in this repository: the app refuses to
# start accounts with one (src/social/client.js) and a test fails if one is written into a file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
